OL,3,GNEWSANursery proposed on site of former
OL,4,Acare home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former care home in Surrey is set to
OL,7,Fbe transformed into a nursery for
OL,8,Fnearly 100 children.
OL,10,FThe old Queens Park Lodge building in
OL,11,FCaterham would become a day centre if a
OL,12,Fplanning application submitted to
OL,13,FTandridge District Council is approved.
OL,15,FSquirrel Wood Properties Ltd, who put
OL,16,Fin the application, said the nursery
OL,17,Fwould cater for up to 95 children and
OL,18,Fhave about 26 full-time staff,
OL,19,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
