OL,3,GNEWSANursery proposed on site of former
OL,4,Acare home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows a public consultation held
OL,7,Fin September, where the developer said
OL,8,Fthe proposal was "generally well
OL,9,Freceived", despite concerns around
OL,10,Ftraffic and parking.
